<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-055" chapter-id="c-nanshi-055-xiahoukui-sons" source-id="s-nanshi-055-xiahoukui-sons-ws1748893">
  <p id="c-nanshi-055-xiahoukui-sons:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-055-xiahoukui-sons:p001:m0000" ref="zz1_0tr_xni_B">夔</persName>在州七年，遠近多附之，有部曲萬人，馬二千匹，並服習精強，爲當時之盛。性奢豪，後房伎妾曳羅綺飾金翠者百數。愛好人士，不以貴位自高，文武賓客常滿坐，時亦以此稱之。卒於州，諡曰桓。子<persName id="c-nanshi-055-xiahoukui-sons:p001:m0089" ref="zz1_0tr_xni_BA">撰</persName>嗣，官至太僕卿。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-055-xiahoukui-sons:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-055-xiahoukui-sons:p002:m0000" ref="zz1_0tr_xni_B">夔</persName>子 <persName id="c-nanshi-055-xiahoukui-sons:p002:m0003" ref="zz1_0tr_xni_BB">譒</persName></p>
</text>
